 </p>
 <a href="#contact" class="btn primary">LET'S CONNECT →</a>
</section>

<section class="investor" id="investors">
 <div class="tag">PARTNERSHIP</div>
 <h2>Grow With Our Vision</h2>
 <p>
  Interested in business collaboration or exploring future
