 </p>
</section>

<section class="contact" id="contact">
 <div class="contact-box">
  <div class="tag">GET IN TOUCH</div>
  <h2>Let's Connect</h2>
  <p>Have a business idea, question or collaboration proposal?
  Contact the AGL team.</p>
  <div class="social">
   <!-- Replace these links with your actual profiles -->
   <a href="https://instagram.com/" target="_blank">Instagram</a>
